  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh -  Brick Kiln Efficiency Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective is to promote the use of a cleaner brick making technology (Hybrid Hoffman Kiln) to reduce air pollution and greenhouse gas emissions. This will be achieved by leveraging the potential carbon finance benefits from energy efficiency improvement. Hence making the alternative cleaner technology economically more viable.</narrative>
  </description>
